  "steps": [
    "Heat 1 tsp oil in a pan. Add chopped garlic and green chillies — sauté till fragrant.",
    "Add onion and bell peppers. Cook for 1–2 minutes till slightly soft but still crunchy.",
    "Add the boiled soyabean along with a splash of water.",
    "Season with salt, pepper, red chilli powder and mixed herbs. Mix well.",
    "Stir in ketchup + Schezwan chutney. Let it simmer for 2–3 minutes till everything comes together and looks glossy.",
    "Add cheese on top (optional), cover the pan and let it melt for 3–4 minutes.",
    "Spoon this spicy, saucy beans over toasted wholewheat bread."
